    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD \ud83d\udce2</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Discover the true power of light in Whispers of West Grove, a psychological horror set in a world of growth and decay. Playing as a patient #001 in West Grove Psychiatric Hospital, you find that actions in your dreams affect reality. Using this ability, you can attempt to escape Dr. Kade's increasingly dangerous treatments before it's too late.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/a51f53db22d7b61a313651f1fa4f0248.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/a51f53db22d7b61a313651f1fa4f0248.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/a51f53db22d7b61a313651f1fa4f0248.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With a foggy memory, explore your dreams to retrieve items and uncover clues to help you remember your past. However, one must tread carefully when exploring the town of West Grove. Dreams can quickly turn into nightmares when creatures of the asylum start hunting you. Find weapons, supplies, and other characters to aid in your survival. If all else fails, shift the light to outsmart your foes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/53f0d4f11bc7ab93917bf8b00cf64a0f.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/53f0d4f11bc7ab93917bf8b00cf64a0f.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/53f0d4f11bc7ab93917bf8b00cf64a0f.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This journey will be challenging, with each dream featuring multiple puzzles and enemies designed around it. It is sure to test your combat and puzzle-solving skills.<br><br>Sharpen your skills or your knife. Utilize multiple strategies to avoid or engage with enemies. Unique abilities for each weapon allow for offensive and defensive playstyles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/f9f48bc3a3ebd4cacc74ca2a4c062e49.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/f9f48bc3a3ebd4cacc74ca2a4c062e49.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/f9f48bc3a3ebd4cacc74ca2a4c062e49.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Narrative</h2><u>Intro</u><br>Based in the 1960s, you\u2019ve been admitted into West Grove asylum after a serious incident causes a mental breakdown. Being placed in the intensive treatment wing, you\u2019re under the supervision of the lead doctor - Dr. Kade. However something\u2019s not right with him, and once he begins performing increasingly extreme treatments on his patients you realize you\u2019re in danger.<br><br><u>The Dream World</u><br>Following a failed lobotomy you lose your ability to speak and that\u2019s when the nightmares begin. Monsters in the shadows, abducted patients, and whispers hinting at what\u2019s to come. These recurring nightmares begin to spill over into the day causing dream and reality to begin to blur. Your only hope is to utilize a mysterious flashlight that alters your perception of the world, but be careful - you don\u2019t want to get lost in fiction\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/3892f7f6864cdcb4c28aa2afb6eb46f7.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/3892f7f6864cdcb4c28aa2afb6eb46f7.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/3892f7f6864cdcb4c28aa2afb6eb46f7.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Discover the true power of light in Whispers of West Grove, a psychological horror set in a world of growth and decay. Playing as a patient #001 in West Grove Psychiatric Hospital, you find that actions in your dreams affect reality. Using this ability, you can attempt to escape Dr. Kade's increasingly dangerous treatments before it's too late.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/a51f53db22d7b61a313651f1fa4f0248.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/a51f53db22d7b61a313651f1fa4f0248.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/a51f53db22d7b61a313651f1fa4f0248.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With a foggy memory, explore your dreams to retrieve items and uncover clues to help you remember your past. However, one must tread carefully when exploring the town of West Grove. Dreams can quickly turn into nightmares when creatures of the asylum start hunting you. Find weapons, supplies, and other characters to aid in your survival. If all else fails, shift the light to outsmart your foes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/53f0d4f11bc7ab93917bf8b00cf64a0f.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/53f0d4f11bc7ab93917bf8b00cf64a0f.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/53f0d4f11bc7ab93917bf8b00cf64a0f.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This journey will be challenging, with each dream featuring multiple puzzles and enemies designed around it. It is sure to test your combat and puzzle-solving skills.<br><br>Sharpen your skills or your knife. Utilize multiple strategies to avoid or engage with enemies. Unique abilities for each weapon allow for offensive and defensive playstyles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/f9f48bc3a3ebd4cacc74ca2a4c062e49.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/f9f48bc3a3ebd4cacc74ca2a4c062e49.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/f9f48bc3a3ebd4cacc74ca2a4c062e49.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Narrative</h2><u>Intro</u><br>Based in the 1960s, you\u2019ve been admitted into West Grove asylum after a serious incident causes a mental breakdown. Being placed in the intensive treatment wing, you\u2019re under the supervision of the lead doctor - Dr. Kade. However something\u2019s not right with him, and once he begins performing increasingly extreme treatments on his patients you realize you\u2019re in danger.<br><br><u>The Dream World</u><br>Following a failed lobotomy you lose your ability to speak and that\u2019s when the nightmares begin. Monsters in the shadows, abducted patients, and whispers hinting at what\u2019s to come. These recurring nightmares begin to spill over into the day causing dream and reality to begin to blur. Your only hope is to utilize a mysterious flashlight that alters your perception of the world, but be careful - you don\u2019t want to get lost in fiction\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/3892f7f6864cdcb4c28aa2afb6eb46f7.poster.avif?t=1739391030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/3892f7f6864cdcb4c28aa2afb6eb46f7.webm?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228840/extras/3892f7f6864cdcb4c28aa2afb6eb46f7.mp4?t=1739391030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
